//ERR 11 12 11 17
//MSG="Maximum possible depth for this continue statement is 1."

// The `cnt` half of 61e_break_level_deeper_than_the_loops.cpl. Two blocks are
// written, but the inner one is an `if`, so the `cnt 2` still has only one loop
// above it — levels count loops, not blocks, as 33_break_two_counts_loops_not_blocks.cpl
// shows from the passing side.

fn main
    for i 0..3
        if i > 0
            cnt 2
